---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, PHONE, PHONE_TEL } from '../../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<BaseHead title={`Water Heater Service | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Water heater repair, replacement, and installation in Yucaipa, CA. Tank and tankless systems." />
</head>
<body>
	<Header />

	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Water Heater Service</h1>
			<p>Repair, replacement, and installation of tank and tankless water heaters.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="content">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="content-grid">
				<div>
					<h2>Water Heater Services</h2>
					<p>Reliable hot water is essential. We service both traditional tank and modern tankless water heaters.</p>
					<ul>
						<li>No hot water or insufficient hot water</li>
						<li>Leaking tank or fittings</li>
						<li>Strange noises, odors, or rusty water</li>
						<li>Pilot light and ignition issues</li>
						<li>Thermostat and element replacement</li>
						<li>Full water heater replacement</li>
						<li>Tankless installation and maintenance</li>
					</ul>
					
					<h3>Repair vs. Replace</h3>
					<p>We will honestly assess whether a repair makes sense or if replacement is the better long-term value — based on age, condition, and efficiency.</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>Tankless Options</h3>
					<p>Tankless (on-demand) water heaters can provide endless hot water and may reduce energy use. We can help you decide if a tankless upgrade is right for your home and install it properly.</p>
					
					<h3>Local Expertise</h3>
					<p>Southern California water conditions and code requirements are familiar territory. We size systems correctly and ensure safe, code-compliant installation and venting.</p>
					
					<div class="mt-2">
						<a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Request Water Heater Quote</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="cta">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Hot Water Problems?</h2>
			<p>Call today for water heater service in Yucaipa.</p>
			<a href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {PHONE}</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<Footer />
</body>
</html>
